Advanced Agentic AI Engineer Program
Duration: 65 Days Learning Style: 70% Hands-on, 30% Technical Theory Primary Environment: VS Code + GitHub Expectation: Every concept is implemented as working code

🔹 Mandatory Prerequisites
Students must already know:
Python fundamentals
functions, classes, error handling
VS Code
terminal, extensions, debugging
GitHub
repositories, commits, README, branching
No ML, DL, or math background required.

🔹 Program Philosophy (Important)
Every module introduces a new agent paradigm
Every module introduces new tools / frameworks
Every module ends with a production-style project
Code-first, not prompt-first
GitHub is mandatory for all submissions

